Adaptation 02-principle-consolidation

The 24 principle-* skills and the always-on unslop skill are retired. Source exclusions remove the
principle directories and this patch removes unslop. Their guidance lives in four
conditional references, poteto-mode/references/engineering-{design,evolution,verification,coordination}.md,
which the other skills link to; poteto-mode routes by task instead of mandating panels for routine work.
Rebased onto pstack 0.15.46 / pstack-claude 0.9.153 (including the new agy/omp/opencode/kimi/grok
mappings and shortened playbooks).

Fork source: https://github.com/mneves75/pstack-claude commits 296c78d, d13480d, 3017177 (rebased to 1ab6b82).
Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

